---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - DailyRadar"
  description="Privacy policy and data collection transparency statement for DailyRadar users and visitors."
  canonicalUrl="https://radar.yourdomain.com/privacy"
>
  <div style="max-width: 750px; margin: 2rem auto; line-height: 1.8;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); padding-bottom: 0.75rem;">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Last Updated: September 2026
    </p>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
        1. Information We Collect
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        DailyRadar does not require user accounts or personal profiles to browse our directory. We do not collect names, passwords, or personal payment credentials.
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
        Like most standard websites, we may collect anonymous aggregate technical data (such as browser type, operating system, referrer URL, and visit timestamp) to analyze directory performance and improve site speed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
        2. Cookies & Advertising
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        We may use minimal local storage or functional cookies to preserve user preferences (such as dark mode settings).
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
        In the future, we may display third-party advertisements (such as Google AdSense, EthicalAds, or Carbon Ads). These third-party vendors may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to our website or other websites on the internet.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
        3. External Links
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
        Our service contains links to external websites, software repositories, and independent creator projects. If you click on a third-party link, you will be directed to that site. We strongly advise you to review the Privacy Policy of every site you visit.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
